%% Source: contracts/rest/expense-core.openapi.json, contracts/events/envelope.schema.json
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant B as GraphQL BFF
    participant E as Expense Core REST
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Q as RabbitMQ
    participant N as Notifications REST

    C->>B: createExpense mutation + idempotency key
    B->>E: POST /v1/expenses (validated DTO)
    E->>E: authenticate, authorize, validate, calculate exact allocations
    E->>DB: transaction: expense + postings + audit + sync change + outbox
    DB-->>E: commit
    E-->>B: 201 expense + requestId
    B-->>C: mutation result
    E->>Q: publish outbox event after commit
    Q->>N: expense.created event
    N->>N: resolve notification preferences and templates
    N-->>C: WebSocket change subscription / email delivery

    Note over E,DB: No cross-service SQL, entities, or repositories
    Note over DB,Q: Financial state and outbox commit atomically
